# Must be excluded, and for a reason worth writing down.
#
# `incremental: true` (packages/tsconfig/base.json) makes tsc record what it has
# already emitted in a .tsbuildinfo beside each tsconfig. Those files are
# gitignored, so they never reach CI — but a Docker build copies the working
# tree, not a clean checkout. Copy them in while `dist` above is excluded and
# tsc reads a manifest claiming the outputs exist, finds nothing to do, and
# emits almost nothing: exit code 0, no diagnostics, and an image whose
# libraries are missing most of their compiled files. The failure surfaces
# later, as `Module '@bam/observability' has no exported member …` in whichever
# app happens to import one of them first.
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
docs
.vscode
.idea
packages/db/src/generated
